<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Hui Shung to tender for 54,500T US soy/corn.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Hui Shung to tender for 54,500T US soy/corn.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's Hui Shung Group will tender on Thursday for a combined shipment comprising 38,500 tonnes of U.S. No.2 soybeans and 16,000 tonnes of U.S. No.2 corn, traders said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The Hui Shung Group includes Hui Shung Agriculture and Food Corp, Eagle Food Industry and Charoen Pokphand.</p>
<p>Details for the tender are as follows:</p>
<p>			   U.S. Gulf    Pacific N.W.</p>
<p> Corn	16,000    April 1-15   April 16-30</p>
<p> Soybean   38,500    April 1-15   April 16-30</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
